From 569a8d55de8a2522e1023e68f7dadf5036cfbf26 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:52:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Persist frozen diagnostic actionability transport
 custody

M1 administrative diagnostics only; no producer activation, admission, status, lease, budget or release authority. Preserve exact outbox bytes and canonical root/deadline/notice evidence through ACK loss and local cache loss.
